    "columnsOwner": "OfficeIMO.Html/Rendering/HtmlRenderLayoutEngine.Columns.cs",
    "behavior": "Generated columns use x = contentX + fragment.Column * (columnWidth + gap), including columns beyond requestedCount. Explicit fixed height keeps the generated overflow inline; print fitting widens proportional columns without removing the overflow.",
